for 48 inch Nostalgie Induction or Dual Fuel with Frenchtop</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>985.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+en48c82211\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/EN48C82211_p164526.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE Chrome Knobs and Handles Bundle for 48 inch Nostalgie Dual Fuel with Griddle</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>1,091.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+en48g62211\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/EN48G62211_p164527.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE Brass Knobs and Handles Bundle for 48 inch Nostalgie Induction or Dual Fuel with Frenchtop</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>931.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+en48g82211\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/EN48G82211_p164520.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE Brass Knobs and Handles Bundle for 48 inch Nostalgie Dual Fuel with Griddle</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>1,031.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+en48p62211\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/EN48P62211_p164530.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE Copper Knobs and Handles Bundle for 48 inch Nostalgie Induction or Dual Fuel with Frenchtop</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>2,245.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+en48p82211\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/EN48P82211_p164523.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE Copper Knobs and Handles Bundle for 48 inch Nostalgie Dual Fuel with Griddle</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>2,495.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+es4053008030006\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/ES4053008030006_p16237-1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE ES4053008030006 Drip Pan For Standard Oven</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>130.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+es5308001000008\\\"><div><img loadin