08.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">ILVE USA Nostalgie Order Form.pdf</a></li><li><i></i> <a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/UN48FNMPMGBLP-90788_7598.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">ILVE-Warranty.pdf</a></li><li><i></i> <a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/UN48FNMPMGBLP-90788_64074.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Installing Cylinder Legs \\u2013 7 Simple Steps for a Perfect ILVE Nostalgie Range Setup.pdf</a></li><li><i></i> <a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/UN48FNMPMGBLP-90788_63734.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Mastering ILVE Gas Cooktops.pdf</a></li><li><i></i> <a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/UN48FNMPMGBLP-90788_4218.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Nostalgie II Manual.pdf</a></li><li><i></i> <a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/UN48FNMPMGBLP-90788_7450.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Nostalgie-II-Overview.pdf</a></li><li><i></i> <a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/UN48FNMPMGBLP-90788_7451.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Nostalgie-II-Range-Specs.pdf</a></li><li><i></i> <a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/UN48FNMPMGBLP-90788_7452.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Nostalgie-II-UP48N-Spec-Sheet.pdf</a></li><li><i></i> <a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/UN48FNMPMGBLP-90788_10454.jpg\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Oven-Icon-Functions.jpg</a></li></ul> </div> </div> </div> <h3 class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtitle\\\"><span aria-controls=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_accessories\\\" aria-selected=\\\"false\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tab mod-last\\\" data-slug=\\\"accessories\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tab_accessories\\\" role=\\\"tab\\\" tabindex=\\\"-1\\\"> <span class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtext\\\">Accessories</span> </span></h3> <div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"station-tabs-tab_accessories\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_accessories\\\" role=\\\"tabpanel\\\"> <div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"> <div><div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+a0953610\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/A0953610_p20021-1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE A/095/36/10 Simmer Plate</div><span><b