\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Nostalgie-II-Range-Specs.pdf</a></li><li><i></i> <a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/UN48FSNMPBUB-90788_7452.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Nostalgie-II-UP48N-Spec-Sheet.pdf</a></li><li><i></i> <a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/UN48FSNMPBUB-90788_10454.jpg\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Oven-Icon-Functions.jpg</a></li></ul> </div> </div> </div> <h3 class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtitle\\\"><span aria-controls=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_accessories\\\" aria-selected=\\\"false\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tab mod-last\\\" data-slug=\\\"accessories\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tab_accessories\\\" role=\\\"tab\\\" tabindex=\\\"-1\\\"> <span class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtext\\\">Accessories</span> </span></h3> <div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"station-tabs-tab_accessories\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_accessories\\\" role=\\\"tabpanel\\\"> <div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"> <div><div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+a0953610\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/A0953610_p20021-1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE A/095/36/10 Simmer Plate</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>49.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/.\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/A41802_p20023-1.png\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE A/418/02 Pizza Stone For Maxi Oven</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>182.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/.\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/A41804_p20024-1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE A/418/04 Pizza Stone For Mini and Midi Ovens</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>109.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+a48401\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/A48401_p20025.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE A/484/01 11 inch Chopping Board</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>252.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+am4120\\\"><div><img loading