[\"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391-1.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_159998.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_159999.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_159997.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_19243-1.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_19244-1.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_19245-1.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_19246-1.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_19247-1.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_19248-1.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_19249-1.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UN48FSNMPWHGLP_p113391_26300-1.jpg\"], \"Variant Price\": \"12990.00\", \"Variant Barcode\": \"8051202548601\", \"Variant URLS\": \"\", \"Variant Count\": \"\", \"Variant HTML\": \" <div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"station-tabs-tab_description\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel station-tabs-default-tabpanel\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_description\\\" role=\\\"tabpanel\\\"> <div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"><div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"><p>Introducing the new Nostalgie II 48\\\" dual fuel range, a timeless addition to any kitchen with a dash of innovation. This line includes sealed burners with a total black brass burner with a non-stick nanotechnological coating, heavy cast iron grates, and 3.5 + 1.52 cu sq. soft-closing door system and a total of two ovens.</p><p>Pre-Order (90\\u2013120 Days)</p><div><p><strong>Nostalgia</strong></p><p>The flavor of tradition with a contemporary twist.</p><p></p><p>The ideal fusion of the past and present, forming the core of your home Nostalgie is a line of cooking systems that combines cutting-edge technology with sophisticated retro aesthetic inspiration.</p><p></p><p>Nostalgie range cookers combine top-notch materials and highly advanced technologies with a timeless design that never fails to inspire. Unquestionably the leaders of the kitchen, they provide a wide range of sizes (from 30 to 60 inches) and configurations: single or double ovens, standard colors or RAL colors upon request, flush-top induction up to 6 cooking zones with bridge function for the 48-inch version, and a variety of finishes and accessories. Noblesse frames, which are only an option for the Nostalgie collection, are more than just a detail; they are a lovely design element that frames the front panels and matches the metallic finishes of the handles and knobs. Another choice that tastefully enhances the Nostalgie style is the blind door that draws inspiration from the past.</p><p></p><ul><li>Dual gas burners with a maximum power of 25,000 BTU are standard.</li><li>Burner in total black brass with nanotechnology-based non-stick coating</li><li>Highly specialized cooktops</li><li>Cooktop (Hob) with cast iron pan supports.</li><li>Precise electronic temperature regulation</li><li>Soft-closing door and drawer</li><li>Quick start</li></ul><p></p><hr/><p><strong>Product Technologies</strong></p><p>Although aesthetics are significant, they are not the only factor. To cook effectively and enjoyably, you need the best technologies available. ILVE puts all of its research and experience to work for you, providing solutions that combine top-notch performance with maximum simplicity, safety, and user-friendliness, always ensuring the highest level of satisfaction.</p><p></p><p><strong>Dual Gas Burners with 25,000 BTU of Power</strong></p><p>Provides the ideal power for flawless cooking at all times, as well as optimal and perfect flame distribution for all types of cooking.</p><p></p><p><strong>Total Black Brass Burner with Nanotechnological Non-Stick Coating</strong></p><p>Brass has an elegant black finish and a nanotechnological coating that ensures easy cleaning, enhancing its noble technical qualities.</p><p></p><p><strong>Cooktop (Hob) with Cast Iron Pan Supports</strong></p><p>For all types of pots and pans, the extremely sturdy cast-iron pan grates offer a practical and secure support.</p><p></p><hr/><p><strong>Oven Technology</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Large Size and Performance</strong></p><p>Any single or double combination oven you select will give you all the space you require, even for large dishes. Our 48-inch range has an oven capacity of up to 4 cubic feet.</p><p></p><p><strong>Accurate Electronic Temperature Control</strong></p><p>The electronic control makes sure that the oven's temperature doesn't change throughout, unlike in traditional ovens.</p><p></p><p><strong>Quick Start</strong></p><p>With the quick preheating function, you can quickly reach your desired temperature before selecting the cooking mode that best suits your dish. When set to a low temperature, it also functions as a quick defrosting device.</p><p></p><p><strong>Soft Closing Door System</strong></p><p>A shock absorber installed in the door hinges allows for a more gradual and silent closing.</p><p></p><p><strong>Primary Oven Functions: UOV 80 M</strong></p><p></p><ul><li>Pizza function</li><li>Quick start</li><li>Multiple fans cooking</li><li>Cooking intensively</li><li>Cooking on a fan grill</li><li>Grill cooking with a closed door</li><li>Cooking from above</li><li>Cooking from below</li><li>Normal cooking that is static</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Secondary Oven Functions: UOV 30 E</strong></p><p></p><ul><li>Grill cooking with a closed door</li><li>Cooking from above</li><li>Cooking from below</li><li>Normal cooking that is static</li></ul><hr/><p><strong>Oven Operation.</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Pizza Function</strong></p><p>Suitable for baking pizza, as well as bread and focaccia The lower heating element serves as the primary heat source and, along with the other underpowered heating elements, produces the ideal environment for this kind of cooking.</p><p></p><p><strong>Quick Start</strong></p><p>When the oven is preheated quickly, it can quickly reach the desired temperature, at which point you can select the cooking mode that best suits the dish. If the oven is set to a low temperature, it can also quickly defrost food.</p><p></p><p><strong>Cooking with Several Fans</strong></p><p>This feature enables cooking multiple dishes at once without the smells blending. Lasagna, croissants and brioches, tarts, cakes, etc. can be baked, saving time and electricity.</p><p></p><p><strong>Cooking Intensive</strong></p><p>With steam discharge, it guarantees quick and thorough cooking. Baked potatoes and vegetables, chicken, salt-crusted fish, etc. are advised for a crispy outcome.</p><p></p><p><strong>Cooking on a Fan Grill</strong></p><p>This function is especially quick and deep, and it saves a lot of energy. It can be used for a variety of foods, including game, pork chops, sausages, pork or mixed kebabs, and Roman-style gnocchi.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grill Cooking with a Closed Door</strong></p><p>Recommended for quick and deep grilling, browning, and roasting meat in general, fillet, Florentine steak, fish, and even vegetables.</p><p></p><p><strong>Cooking from Above</strong></p><p>It is especially good for browning and adding the last bit of color to many foods; it is the recommended function for burgers, pork chops, veal steaks, sole, cuttlefish, etc.</p><p></p><p><strong>Cooking from the Ground Up</strong></p><p>Pastries (biscuits, meringues, leavened desserts, fruit desserts, etc.) are best cooked using this technique to finish the cooking cycle.</p><p></p><p><strong>Cooking Static Normal</strong></p><p>Pork chops, sausages, salt cod, braised meat, game, roast veal, meringues and biscuits, baked fruit, etc. can all be cooked in this traditional electric oven function.</p><p></p><hr/><ul><p><strong>Customize Your Selection</strong></p><li><strong>Knobs and Handle Bundles for the Griddle Range Copper: EN48P82211, Brass: EN48G82211, Burnished: EN48B82211, and Chrome: EN48C82211</strong>Knobs and Handle Bundles for the Griddle Range Copper: EN48P82211, Brass: EN48G82211, Burnished: EN48B82211, and Chrome: EN48C82211</li><li><strong>Knobs and Handle Bundles for Griddle/French Top Range Copper: EN48P62211, Brass: EN48G62211, Burnished: EN48B62211, and Chrome: EN48C62211</strong>Knobs and Handle Bundles for Griddle/French Top Range Copper: EN48P62211, Brass: EN48G62211, Burnished: EN48B62211, and Chrome: EN48C62211</li><li><strong>Handles EA4270003000020, EA4270008000020 (Copper), EA4270003000016, EA4270008000016 (Brass), EA4270003000018, EA4270008000018 (Burnished), EA42700030000008, and EA42700080000008 (Chrome)</strong>Handles EA4270003000020, EA4270008000020 (Copper), EA4270003000016, EA4270008000016 (Brass), EA4270003000018, EA4270008000018 (Burnished), EA42700030000008, and EA42700080000008 (Chrome)</li><li><strong>The Knobs Standard Knobs: EG9493002000120 (Copper), EG9493002000116 (Brass), EG9493002000118 (Burnished), EG9494005000118 (Burnished), EG9494005000108 (Chrome) Oven Function Knobs: EG9488014000120 (Copper), EG9488014000116 (Brass), EG9488014000118 (Burnished), EG</strong>The Knobs Standard Knobs: EG9493002000120 (Copper), EG9493002000116 (Brass), EG9493002000118 (Burnished), EG9494005000118 (Burnished), EG9494005000108 (Chrome) Oven Function Knobs: EG9488014000120 (Copper), EG9488014000116 (Brass), EG9488014000118 (Burnished), EG</li></ul><p></p><hr/><p><strong>Limited 2-Year Parts and Labor Warranty</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Proposition 65 in California</strong></p><p>WARNING: Cancer and Reproductive Harm</p><p><strong><a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">W.<span>P65Warnings.ca.gov</span></a></strong></p></div> <div><div> <div> <video controls=\\\"\\\" preload=\\\"auto\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/G6YTfYuEtZg.mp4\\\" style=\\\"max-w